📢 Traffic Advisory: Temp Detour on VFW Highway Westbound Begins Mon, Dec 15

@MassDOT has announced daily detours on VFW Hwy Westbound between Mammoth Rd and Riverside St, beginning Mon, Dec 15, 9AM - 3PM. These detours will continue until further notice.

See full advisory ⬇️ https://t.co/NlWUgOGn8Z
